---
import ToolLayout from '../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
import ConvertFormat from '../../components/tools/ConvertFormat';
---

<ToolLayout
  title="Convert HEIC to PNG Free Online | Filekrush"
  description="Convert iPhone HEIC photos to PNG with lossless quality. No upload, runs in your browser."
  canonical="/convert/heic-to-png"
  heading="Convert HEIC to PNG"
  subheading="Convert iPhone photos to PNG — free, private, instant."
>
  <ConvertFormat client:only="react" fromFormat="image/heic" toFormat="image/png" />

  <Fragment slot="content">
    <section class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <h2>Why convert HEIC to PNG?</h2>
      <p>If you need lossless quality from your iPhone photos — for editing, printing, or graphic design work — PNG is better than JPG. Converting HEIC to PNG preserves maximum detail without the compression artifacts that JPG introduces.</p>

      <h2>When to use JPG instead?</h2>
      <p>If file size matters more than perfect quality (email, web uploads, forms), convert to JPG instead. PNG files from iPhone photos will be significantly larger than JPG equivalents.</p>
    </section>
  </Fragment>
</ToolLayout>
